      "llm_reasoning": "The feature flag endpoint is exposed without rate limiting, making it susceptible to enumeration or DoS if the configuration file is large or accessed frequently.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware to restrict the number of requests to the API endpoints."
